    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) · **English**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Slack",
      "text": "**Bring task notifications and thread replies to Slack.**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-slack) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-slack) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-slack)\n\n**[Install](#install) · [Workflow](#start-using-it) · [Full guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Slack",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-light.svg\" alt=\"Bring task notifications and thread replies to Slack. · workflow illustration\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Send channel notifications or thread replies.\n- Use visible channels and the Socket Mode inbox.\n- Inspect connection state and handle authentication or reconnect issues."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Open **Plugins** in the DSH desktop app and install `dsh-slack`. If the CLI is available:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-slack\n```\n\nFor the web profile, replace `desktop` with `web`. Restart that DSH profile after installation. The package’s DSH requirement is `>=0.2.1-rc.3`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "1. Configure permissions and Socket Mode for your Slack App, and obtain Bot and App-level tokens.\n2. Enter the tokens in DSH Slack settings and check the connection state.\n3. Verify incoming messages in your own test channel before asking for summaries or thread replies.\n4. Verify the channel, thread and text before sending. Check Slack for the result and inspect connection state before retrying.\n\nExample request："
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "> Check Slack and prepare a project update. Confirm the channel and content before sending."
    },
    {
      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "Requires your own Slack App, permissions and tokens. Access is limited to messages visible to the bot.\n\nConfiguration, detailed tools and troubleshooting: [full reference](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin updates",
      "text": "Check updates at the bottom of the workbench or native plugin details. Automatic checks are on by default; **automatic installation is off**. You choose whether to install and when to restart. Suite-managed components update with their bundle. [Update behavior](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Documentation",
      "text": "- [Full usage, configuration and limits](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Validation scope and history](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/blob/main/docs/VALIDATION.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Feedback and contributions",
      "text": "If the plugin helps, a Star makes it easier for others to discover. Report problems or suggest improvements in [Issues](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/issues); code and documentation [PRs](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-slack/pulls) are welcome. Include versions and reproduction steps, and remove credentials from reports."
    },
    {
